[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0577","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56774","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux kernel 的 btrfs 文件系统在 btrfs_search_slot() 函数中缺少对 btrfs root 的空指针检查。当系统使用 rescue=ibadroots 挂载参数且 extent tree root 损坏时，extent tree 为 NULL，此时 scrub 操作尝试搜索 extent tree 获取 extent 信息时，btrfs_search_slot() 未校验目标 root 是否为空，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。该漏洞需要本地低权限用户触发特定条件利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Linux 内核主线已通过添加健全性检查修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56774"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T18:15:18.213","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:57.657","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：5.15.174、6.1.120、6.6.64、6.12.4 或 6.13 及以上版本。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新内核（如 Ubuntu 运行 apt upgrade linux-image-generic，Debian 运行 apt upgrade linux-image）。如无法立即升级，避免使用 rescue=ibadroots 挂载选项挂载损坏的 btrfs 文件系统，并在生产环境中禁用 scrub 操作对不可信文件系统的扫描。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ed51857a50f530ac7a1482e069dfbd1298558d4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/757171d1369b3b47f36932d40a05a0715496dcab","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/93992c3d9629b02dccf6849238559d5c24f2dece","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c71d114ef68c95da5a82ec85a721ab31f5bd905b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/db66fb87c21e8ae724886e6a464dcbac562a64c6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56774.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56774.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56774","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56774.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56774-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56774.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-phf7-cpqm-749x/GHSA-phf7-cpqm-749x.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56774"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0576","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56770","title":"Linux kernel netem 网络调度器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核网络调度器 netem 的 qlen 计数器存在计数不一致漏洞。netem 作为根 qdisc 使用时，其 qlen 仅统计内部 tfifo 队列中的报文数，未正确计入子 qdisc（如 tbf）中排队的报文。当子 qdisc 通过 qdisc_tree_reduce_backlog 通知 netem 创建或丢弃 SKB 时，netem 的 qlen 被错误更新，导致 qlen 与 tfifo 实际队列深度不一致。攻击者可在本地通过构造特定流量（如启用 GSO 并配置 netem+tbf 组合），使 netem 的 qlen 达到配置的 limit 上限，即使 tfifo 实际为空也无法接收新报文，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 netem 与子 qdisc 组合的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56770"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T17:15:15.957","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.993","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级到以下已修复版本：5.4.288、5.10.232、5.15.175、6.1.121、6.6.67、6.12.6 或更高版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新（如 Debian 11/12 请参考 DLA-4075-1 公告，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7506-1 更新）。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施为避免将 netem 与 tbf 等子 qdisc 配合使用，或禁用 GSO（ethtool -K <接口> gso off）以防止子 qdisc 分段触发 qlen 计数异常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/10df49cfca73dfbbdb6c4150d859f7e8926ae427","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/216509dda290f6db92c816dd54b83c1df9da9e76","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/356078a5c55ec8d2061fcc009fb8599f5b0527f9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3824c5fad18eeb7abe0c4fc966f29959552dca3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/83c6ab12f08dcc09d4c5ac86fdb89736b28f1d31","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c2047b0e216c8edce227d7c42f99ac2877dad0e4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f8d4bc455047cf3903cd6f85f49978987dbb3027","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56770.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/798fe5865a23d1d1dd1aaee2729abd2faf4899d1/projects/linux/CVE-2024-56770/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56770","https://github.com/peass-ng/PEASS-ng/blob/1cabd84639d48c21ba088e07e52661c30c906aef/linPEAS/builder/linpeas_parts/variables/kernel_cve_registry_data.sh","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56770.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56770.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56770-2025-11-03-1451"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0559","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55459","title":"Keras 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Keras 3.7.0 的 get_file 函数存在任意文件写入漏洞（CWE-494）。攻击者可构造包含符号链接或路径遍历载荷的恶意 tar 压缩包，通过诱导用户调用 get_file 函数下载并解压该文件，利用解压过程中未对文件路径进行充分校验的缺陷，将恶意文件写入用户系统的任意目录。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，但需要用户交互，对系统完整性造成高影响，可能导致代码执行或敏感文件覆盖。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55459"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-08T17:15:15.817","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:08.327","remediation":"立即将 Keras 升级至 3.12.3 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade keras>=3.12.3`），该版本已对 `get_file` 函数中的 tar 文件提取进行多项安全加固，包括拒绝硬链接逃逸、阻止符号链接目录遍历、拒绝解压炸弹攻击、使用 `filter=\"data\"` 安全提取模式。如无法立即升级，应避免使用 `get_file` 从不可信来源下载并解压 tar 文件，或在使用前手动校验 tar 文件内容是否包含路径穿越符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/keras-team/keras","https://keras.io","https://river-bicycle-f1e.notion.site/Arbitrary-File-Write-Vulnerability-in-get_file-function-11888e31952580179224e50892976d32","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-55459.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/keras/CVE-2024-55459.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-55459","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55459.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-55459.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/cba1106e73e57152f6afbb7764cd551d404f7b74/vulns/keras/PYSEC-2025-121.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9119295a984ba3fccef08b7eec3fc9b62b1da974/advisories/github-reviewed/2025/01/GHSA-cjgq-5qmw-rcj6/GHSA-cjgq-5qmw-rcj6.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-55459"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0558","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55414","title":"Motorola SM56 Modem WDM Driver 权限提升漏洞","description":"Motorola SM56 Modem WDM 驱动程序 SmSerl64.sys 存在权限提升漏洞，低权限用户可通过向驱动发送特制的 IOCTL 请求映射物理内存，从而获取系统最高权限执行任意代码并泄露敏感信息。该驱动因持有有效数字签名，可绕过微软驱动签名策略被用于加载恶意代码。攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。受影响的驱动版本为 v6.12.23.0，建议立即禁用或替换该驱动。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55414"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-07T18:15:20.987","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:06.960","remediation":"立即卸载 Motorola SM56 Modem WDM Driver v6.12.23.0，在设备管理器中找到该调制解调器驱动并选择\"卸载设备\"；使用 Microsoft Defender for Identity 或 Windows Defender Application Control (WDAC) 将 SmSerl64.sys 加入阻止列表；在企业环境中通过组策略禁止非授权驱动加载，并启用 HVCI（Hypervisor-protected Code Integrity）阻止已知有问题的内核驱动运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/heyheysky/vulnerable-driver/blob/master/CVE-2024-55414/CVE-2024-55414_SmSerl64.sys_README.md","https://us.motorola.com/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55414.json","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2024-55414.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55414.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-55414","https://github.com/magicsword-io/LOLDrivers/blob/35d5ade5c33246ab6cc9565bded5fd7aff0e689e/loldrivers.io/content/drivers/09c46890-5aa1-4122-962e-7ed94754e710.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-55414.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7c78b01f402841eaeb570a26d276cd67a60a9531/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6prq-q63r-xqhp/GHSA-6prq-q63r-xqhp.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2024-55414","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-55414.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-55414.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0561","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-55553","title":"FRRouting FRR 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FRRouting（FRR）在处理 RTR（RPKI-to-Router）协议更新时存在资源管理不当漏洞（CWE-404）。当单次 RTR 更新数据总量超过操作系统默认套接字缓冲区大小（通常为 4KB）时，FRR 会触发对所有路由的重新验证。攻击者可通过在更新间隔内（通常为 30 分钟）发送超过该阈值的 ROA 更新，迫使目标 FRR 路由器持续重新解析 RIB（路由信息库），导致路由处理性能严重下降。对于维护大型全量路由表的路由器，单次重新验证可能超过 30 分钟，攻击者可利用持续签发/撤销大量 ROA 的方式影响全球所有使用 RPKI 的 FRR 实例的路由处理能力，同时导致 BMP（BGP 监控协议）流量激增。该漏洞影响 FRR 6.0 至 10.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。修复版本为 10.0.3、10.1.2、10.2.1 及 10.3 以上。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-55553"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T23:15:07.637","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:13.833","remediation":"升级 FRRouting 至 10.0.3、10.1.2、10.2.1 或 10.3 及以上版本。补丁提交见 https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/pull/17586。如无法立即升级，可通过 `sysctl -w net.core.rmem_default=65536` 临时增大 RTR 套接字接收缓冲区大小（默认 4KB），降低因缓冲区满触发全量路由重校验的频率，但此缓解措施不能完全消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://frrouting.org/security/cve-2024-55553/","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/pull/17586/commits/b0800bfdf04b4fcf48504737ebfe4ba7f05268d3","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00023.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr-www/blob/597982afc99050d3f7f2de614e1e88370e98fa67/content/security/CVE-2024-55553.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-55553","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/55xxx/CVE-2024-55553.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2024-55553-2025-01-23-1705","https://github.com/FRRouting/frr/blob/e6d5610e2022680f9555641241419a58625d2dc4/redhat/frr.spec.in","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-networking/recipes-protocols/frr/frr/CVE-2024-55553.patch","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-55553-in-frrouting-frr-all-routes-are-re--1771406778000.md","https://github.com/opensourcerouting/frr-cves/blob/4b374c7d216bff70f86a0158215cf264f05eed32/CVE-2024-55553/_index.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0545","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-51741","title":"Redis ACL 选择器格式错误拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Redis 内存数据库在处理格式错误的 ACL 选择器时存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。具有足够权限的认证用户可构造特制的 ACL 选择器，当该选择器被访问时触发服务器 panic 导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Redis 7.2.7 之前版本及 7.4.2 之前版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限和高权限认证，CVSS 评分 4.4。Redis 官方已在 7.2.7 和 7.4.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-51741"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T22:15:09.827","updated":"2026-06-17T08:06:13.863","remediation":"立即将 Redis 升级至 7.2.7 或 7.4.2 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复因畸形 ACL 选择器触发服务器 panic 导致拒绝服务的问题。如无法立即升级，可限制具有 ACL 管理权限的用户范围，仅允许受信任的管理员执行 ACL 操作，降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-prpq-rh5h-46g9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-51741.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/51xxx/CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/dicedb/dicedb/blob/9610c664d19aadadbe8890fde502231d677e39fc/00-RELEASENOTES","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2024/51xxx/CVE-2024-51741.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/52e6c365c84db8afe29c8cad291c135c0605264c/specs/v/valkey/valkey.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-51741","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/afea7c0a5537949917b618ac503f7bd64e4673bf/osv/redis/CVE-2024-51741.json.sha512","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/community/redis/APKBUILD","https://github.com/ATLENA/lat-security-vulnerability/blob/bf92a123b0fc1c097e3fbf881b0e4ec63664f59b/redis/2025/CVE-2024-51741.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0525","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-46981","title":"Redis Redis Lua 库命令远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Redis 是一款开源内存数据库，其内嵌的 Lua 脚本引擎存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。经过身份认证的攻击者可通过 EVAL 或 EVALSHA 命令提交特制的 Lua 脚本，操纵垃圾回收器触发内存释放后的非法访问，从而在 Redis 服务器进程中实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Redis 6.2.17 之前、7.2.7 之前以及 7.4.2 之前的版本，攻击需要低权限且攻击复杂度较高。官方已在 7.4.2、7.2.7 和 6.2.17 版本中修复，也可通过 ACL 限制 Lua 脚本执行作为临时缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-46981"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T22:15:09.360","updated":"2026-06-17T07:56:18.577","remediation":"立即升级 Redis 至 7.4.2 / 7.2.7 / 6.2.17 或更高版本。如无法升级，通过 ACL 限制 EVAL 和 EVALSHA 命令执行：在 redis.conf 中配置 `rename-command EVAL \"\"` 和 `rename-command EVALSHA \"\"`，或使用 ACL 规则 `-EVAL -EVALSHA` 禁止非受信用户执行 Lua 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/6.2.17","https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/7.2.7","https://github.com/redis/redis/releases/tag/7.4.2","https://github.com/redis/redis/security/advisories/GHSA-39h2-x6c4-6w4c","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/01/msg00018.html","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2024-46981-detect-redis-vulnerability","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2024-46981-mitigate-redis-vulnerability","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-46981.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2024/CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/fdc43b71a29cfc20dd1d437cc0240b9a31185623/doc/2025-01/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%EF%BD%9CRedis%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2024-46981).md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2024/46xxx/CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/dicedb/dicedb/blob/9610c664d19aadadbe8890fde502231d677e39fc/00-RELEASENOTES","https://github.com/apecloud/kubeblocks/blob/dfa97006f546b969175782280acb92d813b24ae4/docs/release_notes/v0.9.0/0.9.3.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-46981","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-46981.json","https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/b0c5c08da42041355ee2147ca10175ddaf598407/osv/redis/CVE-2024-46981.json.sha512","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/72f2dfae7109a1c22fada87801e672e993ae2d77/community/redis/APKBUILD","https://github.com/publicqi/CVE-2024-46981","https://github.com/xsshk/CVE-2024-46981"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0575","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56769","title":"Linux Kernel dib3000mb DVB前端驱动未初始化值漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DVB 前端驱动 dib3000mb 中的 dib3000_read_reg 函数存在未初始化值漏洞。函数中局部变量 rb[2] 作为 i2c_transfer() 的读取缓冲区使用，当 I2C 传输失败时该缓冲区内容未被清零，导致未定义数据被后续流程使用，可能造成敏感信息泄露或系统崩溃。本地攻击者需具备低权限并接入 DVB USB 设备触发该漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已通过清零 rb 缓冲区修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56769"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:44.063","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.870","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含该补丁的版本：Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1），Debian 11 升级至 linux-image 6.1.0-0.deb11.22-amd64（DLA-4075-1），其他发行版更新至主线内核 v6.13-rc6 以上版本。如无法立即更新，可禁用 DVB 相关硬件或卸载 dib3000mb 驱动模块（modprobe -r dib3000mb）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/035772fcd631eee2756b31cb6df249c0a8d453d7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d6de21f00293d819b5ca6dbe75ff1f3b6392140","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2dd59fe0e19e1ab955259978082b62e5751924c7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3876e3a1c31a58a352c6bf5d2a90e3304445a637","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/53106510736e734ce8b731ba871363389bfbf4c9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c1197c1457bb7098cf46366e898eb52b41b6876a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e11778189513cd7fb2edced5bd053bc18ede8418","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56769.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56769.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56769","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56769-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56769.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56769.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56769-media-dvb-frontends-dib3000mb-fix-u-1771406575000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q23h-j65c-73m4/GHSA-q23h-j65c-73m4.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0574","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0574.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56767","title":"Linux Kernel at_xdmac DMA 引擎空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DMA 引擎 at_xdmac 驱动中存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。在 at_xdmac_prep_dma_memset 函数中，当 at_xdmac_memset_create_desc 返回 NULL（因 len 参数错误或 atchan->free_descs_list 为空导致内存耗尽）时，未进行空指针检查直接解引用，导致内核崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Atmel XDMAC DMA 控制器的 Linux 内核版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限（CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H，CVSS 5.5 MEDIUM），通过触发异常 DMA memset 操作（如传入异常长度或耗尽内存）即可触发空指针解引用导致系统崩溃拒绝服务，可用性影响严重。Linux 内核已通过在 at_xdmac_prep_dma_memset 中增加空指针检查修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56767"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:43.477","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.600","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至包含修复补丁的版本：Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-5.10.223-1 或更新版本（DLA-4075-1）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 或更新版本（USN-7381-1）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-130-generic 或更新版本（USN-7459-1）；其他发行版升级至 Linux 内核 6.12.2、6.11.11、6.6.63、6.1.121、5.15.175、5.10.223、5.4.289 或更新版本。临时缓解措施：在不使用 Atmel XDMAC DMA 控制器的系统上，可通过内核启动参数禁用该驱动（modprobe.blacklist=at_xdmac）或在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_DMA_AT_XDMAC 选项后重新编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d229600c54e9e0909080ecaf1aab0642aefa5f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/54376d8d26596f98ed7432a788314bb9154bf3e3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8d364597de9ce2a5f52714224bfe6c2e7a29b303","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c43ec96e8d34399bd9dab2f2dc316b904892133f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e658f1c133b854b2ae799147301d82dddb8f3162","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ed1a8aaa344522c0c349ac9042db27ad130ef913","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fdba6d5e455388377ec7e82a5913ddfcc7edd93b","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56767.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56767.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56767","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56767-2025-11-03-1451","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56767.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56767.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56767-dmaengine-at-xdmac-avoid-null-prt-d-1771406472000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-c9h3-5qgq-g7wx/GHSA-c9h3-5qgq-g7wx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0574.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0573","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0573.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56766","title":"Linux 内核 MTD rawnand 驱动双重释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MTD 子系统中的 rawnand 驱动存在双重释放（double free）漏洞，位于 atmel_pmecc_create_user() 函数中。该函数将 `user` 指针的内存分配方式从 kzalloc() 改为 devm_kzalloc() 后，仍保留了 kfree(user) 调用，导致同一内存区域被释放两次，引发内核崩溃或潜在的内存破坏。攻击者需要本地低权限访问，通过加载特制的 NAND Flash 设备触发该漏洞，可能导致系统拒绝服务或权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56766"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:43.127","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.480","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：4.20 及以上、5.4.289 及以上、5.10.233 及以上、5.15.176 及以上、6.1.123 及以上、6.6.69 及以上、6.12.8 及以上或 6.13-rc5 及以上。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 安全更新；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 更新（升级至 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1）。如无法立即更新内核，可临时限制本地低权限用户加载 Atmel NAND Flash 驱动模块（禁用 atmel_nand 内核模块加载），但建议优先安排内核升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1562871ef613fa9492aa0310933eff785166a90e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d825a241e65f7e3072978729e79d735ec40b80e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6ea15205d7e2b811fbbdf79783f686f58abfb4b7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ca9818554b0f33e87f38e4bfa2dac056692d46cc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2f090ea57f8d6587e09d4066f740a8617767b3d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d8e4771f99c0400a1873235704b28bb803c83d17","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd45c87782738715d5e7c167f8dabf0814a7394a","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56766.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56766.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56766","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-56766.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56766-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56766.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56766-mtd-rawnand-fix-double-free-in-atme-1771408163000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0573.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0572","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56765","title":"Linux Kernel powerpc/pseries VAS 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 powerpc/pSeries 架构的 VAS（虚拟加速器交换板）子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当用户进程通过 mmap 映射 paste 地址时，VMA 地址被保存在 VAS 窗口结构体中，用于在系统迁移时取消映射。然而，当进程调用 munmap() 解除映射后，VAS 窗口中的 VMA 地址并未同步更新，仍指向已释放的内存区域。在后续分区迁移操作中，reconfig_close_windows 函数访问该悬空指针，触发 slab-use-after-free，可能导致内核内存损坏。本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 powerpc pSeries 平台，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56765"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:42.800","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.283","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：6.1.123、6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上。对应补丁提交为 05aa156e156e、6d9cd2710545、8b2282b50845、b7f60ffdfd96。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 `apt update && apt install linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。Debian 用户参考 DLA-4071-1。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 VAS 功能（`modprobe.blacklist=vas`）或避免在受影响系统上执行 LPAR 迁移操作作为缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/05aa156e156ef3168e7ab8a68721945196495c17","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6d9cd27105459f169993a4c5f216499a946dbf34","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8b2282b5084521254a2cd9742a3f4e1d5b77f843","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b7f60ffdfd96f8fc826f1d61a1c6067d828e20b9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56765.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56765","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56765.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56765.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56765-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56765.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56765-powerpcpseriesvas-add-close-callbac-1771406040000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/270a81434b1ea0c21e9b1eeeec5c62d11319dabe/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f6j3-h537-397p/GHSA-f6j3-h537-397p.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0572.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0571","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0571.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56763","title":"Linux Kernel tracing 模块输入验证不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 tracing 子系统中的 tracing_cpumask_write 函数存在输入验证缺陷，当用户写入一个过大的 count 值时，会触发 bitmap_parse_user 中的告警（WARNING），导致内核崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过向 /sys/kernel/tracing/tracing_cpumask 写入特制的大数值触发该漏洞，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 主线内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56763"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:42.150","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:56.020","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.123、6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本。对应发行版用户请安装各自厂商提供的更新包（如 Debian 用户通过 `apt update && apt upgrade` 安装 DLA-4075 更新，Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新）。如无法立即升级，可通过 `echo 0 > /proc/sys/kernel/tracing_cpumask` 禁用 tracing_cpumask 写入功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03041e474a6a8f1bfd4b96b164bb3165c48fa1a3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1cca920af19df5dd91254e5ff35e68e911683706","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2558d753df0628d4187d8e1fd989339460f4f364","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d15f4c2449558ffe83b4dba30614ef1cd6937c3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/98feccbf32cfdde8c722bc4587aaa60ee5ac33f0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f60172b447317cb6c5e74b5601a151866269baf6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56763.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56763.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56763","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-56763-2025-11-03-1439","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56763.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56763.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-56763-tracing-prevent-bad-count-for-traci-1771406159000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-vj55-2cxj-5mrc/GHSA-vj55-2cxj-5mrc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0571.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0570","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56761","title":"Linux kernel x86 FRED 缺失 ENDBRANCH 处理导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 x86 FRED（灵活返回与事件分发）子系统中存在 WFE（WAIT_FOR_ENDBRANCH）状态未清除漏洞。当 CPU 间接分支跟踪器（IBT）处于 WFE 状态时，若解码器发现非 ENDBR 指令会触发 #CP 异常。FRED 机制在入口栈中保存并恢复 WFE 状态，但软件未在异常处理路径中清除该状态，导致从引发 #CP 的指令恢复执行时再次触发 #CP，形成死循环。本地攻击者可通过触发缺失 ENDBRANCH 的 #CP 异常（如运行 IBT 自测程序）造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 x86 架构，CVSS 评分 5.5，需本地低权限访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56761"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:41.480","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55.900","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.6.70、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应补丁提交为 b939f108e86b、dc81e556f2a0、151447859d6f。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 apt update && apt upgrade 安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency（USN-7381-1）或 linux-image-6.8.0-1028-nvidia（USN-7514-1）修复此问题。升级后须重启系统生效。如无法立即升级，可在启动参数中添加 ibt=off 禁用 IBT 作为临时缓解措施，但会降低控制流完整性保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/151447859d6fb0dcce8259f0971c6e94fb801661","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b939f108e86b76119428a6fa4e92491e09ac7867","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dc81e556f2a017d681251ace21bf06c126d5a192","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56761.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56761.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56761","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-56761.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56761.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5965518125739d48e98f0cf3efbf7359253ff7cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-q9hp-vwf8-w58f/GHSA-q9hp-vwf8-w58f.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56761","https://github.com/InfoSecREDD/CVE-Discord-Notify/blob/3f4b2b159624fda9a5cd9efcc2a46893068cd4db/seen_cves.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0569","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0569.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56760","title":"Linux Linux Kernel PCI/MSI irqdomain 缺失处理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PCI/MSI 子系统中存在不恰当的 irqdomain 缺失处理缺陷。在未提供 PCI/MSI 支持的 RISCV 等平台上，当设备尝试启用 MSI-X 中断时，pci_msi_setup_msi_irqs() 函数会触发遗留回退存根（legacy fallback stub），产生内核警告并可能导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 PCI/MSI 层未能正确评估遗留模式是否启用，在缺乏 PCI/MSI 父域关联的情况下仍执行了无效的遗留回退路径。本地攻击者需具备低权限，通过触发特定设备的 MSI-X 中断请求即可利用，影响 Linux 内核各发行版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56760"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:41.173","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55.740","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.69、6.12.8 或 6.13 及以上版本，对应内核提交 b1f7476e07b93、aed157301c65、a60b990798eb 已包含修复。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户可通过 apt update && apt install linux-image-6.8.0-1028-nvidia 安装 USN-7514-1 更新，或安装 USN-7381-1 提供的 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 版本，更新后重启系统生效。RISC-V 平台如不支持 PCI/MSI，可在内核配置中禁用 CONFIG_PCI_MSI 以消除警告。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a60b990798eb17433d0283788280422b1bd94b18","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aed157301c659a48f5564cc4568cf0e5c8831af0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1f7476e07b93d65a1a3643dcb4a7bed80d4328d","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56760.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-56760.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-56760","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-56760.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-7vgm-4f6w-wj5f/GHSA-7vgm-4f6w-wj5f.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-56760.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-56760","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-56760.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0569.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0568","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0568.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56759","title":"Linux 内核 btrfs 使用后释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在写时复制（COW）树块时存在释放后使用漏洞。当启用 trace_btrfs_cow_block() 跟踪点且内核开启 CONFIG_PREEMPT 时，btrfs_force_cow_block() 函数通过 free_extent_buffer_stale() 释放扩展缓冲区并调度 RCU 回收，若当前进程在调用跟踪点前被抢占，已释放的缓冲区将被访问，触发释放后使用。本地攻击者可在低权限条件下利用此漏洞实现权限提升，导致系统崩溃或信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。受影响的包括 Ubuntu、Debian、SUSE 等主流发行版内核，各厂商已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56759"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-06T17:15:40.900","updated":"2026-06-17T08:12:55.563","remediation":"更新内核到 >=5.15.0 版本（或通过发行商（Ubuntu/debian/RedHat等）提供的安全更新），或在跟踪不可用时禁用 tracepoint trace_btrfs_cow_block。Ubuntu: `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --only-upgrade linux-generic`；Debian: `apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade linux-image-$(uname -r)`；Red Hat/Fedora: `dnf upgrade kernel`。如使用 Kubernetes，请确保控制平面和节点均已更新。内核 5.15+ 包含内核 commit 994a2d51f21668bcbb5e7da3b47050d806cf4a08 的修复。实时跟踪如非必须可选禁用：`echo 0 > /sys/kernel/debug/tracing/events/btrfs/trace_btrfs_cow_block/enable`","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/44f52bbe96dfdbe4aca3818a2534520082a07040","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/526ff5b27f090fb15040471f892cd2c9899ce314","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/66376f1a73cba57fd0af2631d7888605b738e499","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9a466b8693b9add05de99af00c7bdff8259ecf19","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ba5120a2fb5f23b4d39d302e181aa5d4e28a90d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3a403d8ce36f5a809a492581de5ad17843e4701","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56759.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56759.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blo